@startuml sequence-msw
title Runtime Sequence: MSW Mode (`VITE_USE_MOCK=msw`)

!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA

actor User
participant "ListView.vue" as VIEW
participant "default/default.ts\n(Orval generated)" as CLIENT
participant "axios.ts\n(mutator)" as MUTATOR
participant "Browser fetch" as FETCH
participant "Service Worker\n(MSW)" as SW
participant "default.msw.ts\n(Orval handlers)" as HANDLERS

== Bootstrap ==

User -> VIEW: ブラウザを開く
note over VIEW: main.ts が起動
VIEW -> SW: import('./mocks/browser')\nworker.start()
note over SW
  Service Worker が
  ブラウザに登録される
end note

== ボタンタップ ==

User -> VIEW: 「読み込み」をタップ
VIEW -> CLIENT: listItems()
CLIENT -> MUTATOR: request<Item[]>({\n  url: '/api/items',\n  method: 'GET'\n})
MUTATOR -> FETCH: axios.get('/api/items')

note over FETCH
  リクエストは外に出る前に
  Service Worker が横取り
end note

FETCH -> SW: intercept
SW -> HANDLERS: 該当する handler を探す
HANDLERS --> SW: example 値を返す\n[{ id:1, name:"ペン",...}, ...]
SW --> FETCH: 200 OK + JSON
FETCH --> MUTATOR: response
MUTATOR --> CLIENT: data
CLIENT --> VIEW: Item[]
VIEW -> User: 商品一覧を描画\n(ペン ¥200 / ノート ¥800)

note over User, HANDLERS
  ★ ネットワークには 1 bit も出ていない
  ★ PC オフラインでも動作する
  ★ DevTools の Network では
    "(from ServiceWorker)" と表示
end note

@enduml
